      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. One thing though, I was glancing at the raw data files earlier and saw some notes about soil liquefaction potential during minor tremors. If the zoning board asks about that specifically, how should we address it in the presentation? We don't want to sound like we're hiding something, but we definitely don't want them flagging the site as risky.",
